  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your nimble defense keeps you on your toes against any attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Uncanny Defense<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When fighting defensively or taking the total defense action, or when using Combat Expertise, you gain a bonus on your Reflex saving throws and to your CMD equal to the dodge bonus to AC you gained from taking that action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc135\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
